{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>From where do I have meat.</b> There is no doubt on their part that I have no meat to give them. If so, when they weep over me and say, ״תְּנָה לָּנוּ בָשָׂר״ (Give us meat), as though power is in my hand and through their weeping I will fulfill their desire — this can only be test whether my conduct follows Your command and what I obtain from You on their behalf."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:21.322269352Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}